- {"self_ref":"\#/texts/474","parent":{"$ref":"\#/pictures/5"},"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"caption","prov":[{"page_no":9,"bbox":{"l":53.8,"t":326.75,"r":559.81,"b":286.42,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT"},"charspan":[0,386]}],"orig":"Figure 6: Example layout predictions on selected pages from the DocLayNet test-set. (A, D) exhibit favourable results on coloured backgrounds. (B, C) show accurate list-item and paragraph differentiation despite densely-spaced lines. (E) demonstrates good table and figure distinction. (F) shows predictions on a Chinese patent with multiple overlaps, label confusion and missing boxes.","text":"Figure 6: Example layout predictions on selected pages from the DocLayNet test-set. (A, D) exhibit favourable results on coloured backgrounds. (B, C) show accurate list-item and paragraph differentiation despite densely-spaced lines. (E) demonstrates good table and figure distinction. (F) shows predictions on a Chinese patent with multiple overlaps, label confusion and missing boxes."}
